OL,5,G1100 Santa Fe
OL,6,     F(1951) Western starring Randolph
OL,7,     FScott. Four brothers leave the
OL,8,     Fdefeated South to seek jobs as the
OL,9,     FUS recovers from the Civil War. As
OL,10,     Fone becomes a railwayman, the
OL,11,     Fothers turn to crime.
OL,12,G1245 Hail the Conquering Hero
OL,13,     F(1944) Satirical wartime comedy
OL,14,     Fstarring Eddie Bracken as a man
OL,15,     Fwho becomes a celebrated war hero
OL,16,     Fdespite having been medically
OL,17,     Fdischarged from the marines after
OL,18,     Fonly a few weeks.
